   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poject support: Three main components; A) Land management - first     registration and digitization of land cadastre, reform of the         Immovable Propoerty Registre Office into a modern, semi self-finaced  orgnisation, B) Spatial planning - national territorial plan and      muncipal spatial plans, C)Municipal infrastructure - WB loans for     improvement of water, waste water, solid waste etc. Alse see 73000693</narrative>
